WEBVTT

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:40.730
Xellos, now working with
Erulogos and Sirius...

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:43.570
...has gotten ahold of Galvayra,
the final Darkstar weapon.

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.900
His objective: to save this
world for the Monster race.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.340
Meanwhile, we're once again on
our way to the Pillar of Light...

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.940
...thanks toJillas, who's now
Filia's new little buddy.

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:57.880
And now, the gateway holding
Darkstar back has begun to open!

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:08.820
Soon the gateway will
be completely open.

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:11.140
There's no turning back now.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.340
Damn it all, Sirius!

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:18.340
Don't you want to
save our world?!

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:22.970
I don't wish to see our world
or this world destroyed.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:26.480
And for that, only one
thing will save both worlds:

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.250
Darkstar must be destroyed!

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:34.150
Impossible! Do you really
think we can kill Darkstar?!

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.830
You haven't
forgotten, have you?

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:44.770
What Darkstar's power
did to our world?

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:49.470
The power he gained after
absorbing our master, Volphied...

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:54.070
...which made him a berserk
demon of destruction!

00:02:56.880 --> 00:03:01.790
How many of us were sacrificed as
we fought him time and time again?

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.890
You'd have us repeat
the same stupidity?!

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:10.290
With a chance to save our world
in our grasp, you ignore it?!

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:17.400
We now possess the five weapons
created by Darkstar himself!

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:18.630
Meaning we have a chance?

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:22.810
I need the power of
both of you to do this!

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.930
Oh, well...

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:02.980
Filia, hang in there!

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.880
If we don't get to the
Pillar of Light fast...

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.610
...it's all over
for this world!

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:08.550
Right!

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:13.660
Filia, full speed
AHEA-A-A-A-AD!!!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:25.600
If we continue to
fight as we have been...

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:28.640
...the gateway will open
before we settle anything...

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:32.640
...and Darkstar will fully
materialize in this world.

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:34.300
And if that happens...

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:37.440
...the now exhausted Gods and
Monsters of this world...

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:40.110
...will have no way to stop
him from destroying it.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:44.420
But with the gateway no
longer under your control...

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:48.450
...he could come back and
destroy your world someday.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.240
Look!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.510
The gateway's about to!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:05.770
You mean?!

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:08.110
"There shall come a
controller of a dark star..."

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.980
The Dark Lord Darkstar!

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.520
All right, let's go!

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:22.190
We won't learn anything unless
we let Xellos and Erulogos act!

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:26.900
Oh, dear. Butting in right
up to the very end.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:30.160
I think this is a little
out of your league.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:49.320
Xellos!

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:52.290
Hey! Lina, what's
the big idea?!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.150
Don't tell me you forgot
what you did to me before!

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:58.360
Not only did you
hit a defenseless girl...

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.870
...but you stole
Galvayra from me, too!

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:03.830
Miss Lina, you should use
THIS on him at once!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:08.930
It's not my fault!
I was following orders!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:12.970
Besides, we don't have
time for this right now!

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:16.280
I'll make you sorry
you did all that later!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.480
Of course, later...

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:22.390
He's right.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.820
It doesn't look like this
is a good time for that now.

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:26.890
What the devil's going on?

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:30.920
Very soon, the gateway leading to
our world will be completely open.

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.790
Meaning we're
just barely in time.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:36.930
Your names are Sirius
and Erulogos, right?

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.060
Did you come to
interfere with us?

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.810
Dunno. That depends on
what you're going to do.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:43.910
What?

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:47.700
If your ultimate goal
is to save your world...

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:49.770
...you have two choices:

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:54.050
Either trap Darkstar
in this world...

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.190
...or else use the power
of the five weapons...

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.990
...to break Darkstar apart
and then destroy him.

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.490
Whichever you decide to do...

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:06.020
...will decide whether we
help you or try to stop you.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.710
This isn't good. We really
don't have much time.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:24.050
So, have you decided what
you're going to do?

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:27.980
My mind is
already made up.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.650
Darkstar will die!

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:34.990
All right!
That means we'll help you!

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:35.960
Guys?

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:36.690
Yeah!

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.800
Use the Darkstar weapons!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.390
All RIGHT!

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:53.340
Light, come forth!

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.440
My sword!

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:00.040
It's been a long time!

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:03.220
Hey, quit it! That spear
belonged to Lord Valgaav!

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.980
You can't just use it!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.660
Mr. Jillas...

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:24.670
And now the five weapons
are finally together.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:28.550
Listen! Like us,
Darkstar's astral body...

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:32.020
...doesn't exist on this
world's astral plane!

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:36.080
That means this world's magic
spells won't affect him!

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.450
You must attack him using
the Darkstar weapons!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:43.950
It's working!

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:49.390
Here it comes...

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:14.290
In a face to face battle,
we can't beat him.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:19.660
First we must use the power of the
five weapons and divide Darkstar!

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:20.800
Right!

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:25.870
I'm ready!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.400
As am I!

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.080
Erulogos...

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:42.120
Why?

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:45.820
We're facing Darkstar,
the dark lord of our world!

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:49.490
How can you all risk
your lives so easily?

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:52.690
This battle has no
meaning for any of you!

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:58.200
Maybe it doesn't,
but if I don't do this...

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:01.500
...I don't know how I'd
face my sister back home.

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:02.230
What?

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:07.010
And, if I abandoned your world,
I'd regret it in the morning.

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:11.210
Besides, we don't know for sure
that this world will be destroyed.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:14.650
That's right!
We should defeat Darkstar!

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:16.550
That'll make everything
turn out all right!

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:18.010
Exactly.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.290
Impossible...

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:31.490
That's how far you've
thought this through?

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:33.500
The world may be destroyed!

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:38.570
To save my world,
I even killed Almayce!

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.910
It's not like we don't
understand how you feel.

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:46.840
Erulogos! This is the first
and last chance we'll have...

00:10:46.920 --> 00:10:49.620
...to avenge everyone who
wanted to destroy Darkstar!

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:57.290
Can we do it?
Can we kill Darkstar?!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.900
We HAVE to do it!

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.850
Now to divide Darkstar's power!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.470
He's wrecking the gateway!

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:18.980
No, you don't!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.510
"Five powers, born in darkness!"

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:25.750
"We command you to change
and cleave darkness away!"

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.420
"Become light!"

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:16.180
Got him!

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:22.970
This is Darkstar...

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:26.780
Darkstar's power should
be cut in half now.

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:31.280
Even so, he's still much
stronger than Phibrizzo was.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:34.290
Meaning, unless we destroy him,
this is all for nothing!

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:41.330
Here he comes!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:45.270
Our magic won't affect him.
Attack with the Darkstar weapons!

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:46.510
Gotcha!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.580
You say our spells won't work,
but what about this?!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:56.450
RAH TILT!

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:07.250
It worked, Mr. Zelgadis!

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:11.730
In that case... Filia!
Give Gourry some help!

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:12.490
Right!

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:14.090
Amelia, you cover Zel!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.370
Leave it to me!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.130
What about you, Miss Lina?

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:21.660
I've got the Ragna Blade
to use when I need it.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.510
And the Giga Slave, too...

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:29.740
What do I do?

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.480
You go hide and try to
stay out of our way!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.290
All right, let's hit
him all at once!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:52.870
Here we go, Mr. Gourry.

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:53.600
Right!

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:55.370
FLAME BREATH!

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:58.770
GO!!!

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:21.190
Isn't it doing anything?!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:25.530
Combining a spell with the Sword of
Light worked against Zanaffar, but!

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.400
Isn't there
something we can do?!

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:36.680
He's reacting to something?

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:41.680
Impossible. Darkstar has no
connection to this world.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:44.410
What would he
be reacting to?

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.000
The jewel...

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.300
What's?

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:15.810
What?!

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:28.030
I HATE this!

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:32.570
What kind of attack is this?

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:36.470
No, he's just trying
to fly away from here!

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.330
He's what?!

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.370
I thought I was going
to be crushed!

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:17.740
Just by moving, Darkstar affects
his surroundings that much?

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:22.280
Impressive. No wonder he's
called a demon of destruction.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.690
But where could
Darkstar be headed?

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:27.880
Everyone, follow Darkstar!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:38.000
Where's he trying to go?

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:41.730
Darkstar has never
behaved like this before.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:42.830
Filia, hurry!

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:45.240
This is as fast as I go!

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:49.710
Go on!
Get the food, Miss Filia!

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:53.050
This is no time for
these stupid gags!

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:54.710
Just what is
the matter with you?!

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:56.280
I think I made her mad.

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:59.590
Whoa! Whoa! Calm down, Filia!
Listen to me!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:01.450
Take us higher!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.990
R- Right!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:04.290
Higher!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.730
Whoa! Look how high we are!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.860
Cold! Cold! Cold! Cold!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.140
Lina! Amelia! Cast a
recovery spell on Filia!

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:20.640
All right!

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:22.240
RECOVERY!

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:26.080
All right! Full speed, DIVE!

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:26.980
RIGHT!

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.060
All right! We've caught up!

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.790
Hang in there, Boss!

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:47.470
Okay... RECOVERY!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:48.600
Recovery!

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:54.940
Recovery!

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.110
Recovery!

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:57.640
Recovery!

00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:58.580
Recovery...

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:09.260
That's... The Temple of
the Fire Dragon King!

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:40.680
Miss Filia!

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:46.860
What?

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:50.730
Why is this
Ancient Dragon gem?

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:58.230
Golden dragons...
Golden dragons...

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:03.580
That voice... And also!

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:06.020
What is it, Miss Filia?

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:08.850
It can't be... Valgaav!

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:10.580
What did you say?!

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.380
Valgaav?

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.490
Golden dragons...

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:21.270
Golden dragons!
Murderers of my race!

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.230
Can it be?

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:24.830
It's really Valgaav?

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:40.710
Valgaav!

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:25.680
V- Valgaav's still alive?!
So, does that mean Darkstar is?!

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:28.190
WHAT THE HECK'S
GOING ON HERE?!

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:30.420
Next time, " He Who
Emerges From Dark Star!"

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:33.470
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
